@page "/accessibility"
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]
@inject IConfiguration Configuration
<PageTitle>Accessibility and feedback · Estiblazor</PageTitle>
<PageMetadata Path="/accessibility" Title="Accessibility and feedback · Estiblazor" Description="Accessibility features, keyboard instructions and ways to report an accessibility barrier in Estiblazor, the online planning poker tool." />
<article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">A SEAT FOR EVERYONE</p><h1>Accessibility and feedback</h1><p>We want everyone to take part in a planning poker session. Our technical accessibility target is WCAG 2.2 Level AA.</p>
<h2>Using Estiblazor</h2><ul><li>Use the “Skip to main content” link to bypass navigation.</li><li>Use Tab and Shift+Tab to move between controls, and Enter or Space to activate buttons.</li><li>Choose a voting card to select it. Choose it again to withdraw. A check mark and announced selected state identify your selection.</li><li>Reorder phases and options with buttons; dragging is not required.</li><li>Switch between light and dark themes. The layout adapts to narrow screens and enlarged text.</li><li>Browser confirmation dialogs protect votes and room history before destructive actions. Cancel keeps your data.</li></ul>
<h2>Connection and saved work</h2><p>Voting needs an active connection. If storage is unavailable, the page shows an error and a retry action. After a server restart you may need to reload the page. Keep the private management link to restore ownership if you lose your browser identity.</p>
<h2>Report an accessibility barrier</h2><p><a href="@ContactUrl">Contact the Estiblazor maintainer about accessibility</a>. Tell us which page or action caused the problem, what you expected and, if relevant, which browser or assistive technology you use. Do not include private management links or confidential room content.</p>
<h2>Assessment and limitations</h2><p>We check public pages and the room flow using automated accessibility tests, keyboard interaction, contrast, narrow layouts and enlarged text. Automated checks do not cover every accessibility requirement. A complete independent audit with screen readers and people using assistive technology has not yet been completed. We do not currently claim independently verified WCAG conformance or legal certification.</p>
<p>Last reviewed: <time datetime="2026-11-12">12 November 2026</time>.</p><p><a href="/how-it-works">Read the planning poker guide</a> or <a href="/">return to Estiblazor</a>.</p></article>
@code { string ContactUrl => Configuration["Accessibility:ContactUrl"] ?? "https://github.com/syonfoppen/Estiblazor/issues/new"; }
